      {
        "n": "Shukai (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-05T09:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-05T10:00:00Z",
        "d": "A unique dip into the musical history of Ukraine with archival label Shukai, journeying back to the ‘90s, playing music from documentaries, sci-fi films, obscure cartoons and late-night music programming, curated by Dmytro Nikolaienko, Dmytro Prutkin and Alec Tsapenko.\nFrom the host: \"Step inside the sonic laboratory of Soviet Ukraine’s Kyivnaukfilm (Eng: Kyiv Science Film, active years 1941-1993) studio — a workshop where composers and sound designers crafted scores for documentary, science, education, and animation films. From eerie synth textures to inventive tape collages, these rare recordings (1967–1990) reveal a secret world of avant-garde music created under censorship yet brimming with experiments.\"",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/shukai/episodes/shukai-24th-september-2025",
